'''FC Ekibastuz''' ({{langx|kk|Екібастұз футбол клубы}}) is a Kazakh professional [[Football (soccer)|football]] club based in [[Ekibastuz]]. Until 2008, the team represented [[Pavlodar]] and was called '''Energetik Pavlodar'''. In 2008, the team played as '''Energetik-2 Ekibastuz'''. In 2009, it was renamed to Ekibastuz FK.<ref name=rename>{{Cite web |url=http://www.lyakhov.kz/football/09/stand09-1.shtml |title=ЧЕМПИОНАТ КАЗАХСТАНА ПО ФУТБОЛУ - 2009. ПЕРВАЯ ЛИГА |access-date=2009-07-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20090719080350/http://www.lyakhov.kz/football/09/stand09-1.shtml |archive-date=2009-07-19 |url-status=dead }}</ref> They are current members of the [[Kazakhstan First Division]]."}}
